  "description": "Tasha's rascal alchemist, Sylvère, has heard the prophecy that he will awaken as a hero, and Yewers, the priest of the Great Temple, has come to bring him to the capital.\n\nWithout a priest, the hero would run wild, but he says he's there to protect the peace of all...\n\nSomehow, this guy can't help but be a rascal?!\n\n\"If this rascal is a trial, I'll accept it...!\"\n\nWill Sylvère and Yewers be able to reach the capital safely?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240024), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/akdskslehtlfus), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/mangnani), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11362672), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/120076380), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000064242)",
